    <briefdescription>
<para>Find similar past Verwaltungsvorgänge (for precedent / reference). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses cosine similarity over stored instance embeddings (key prefix <computeroutput>proc:inst_emb:</computeroutput> &lt;id&gt;) if available, and falls back to variable-based Jaccard similarity otherwise. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
